# The wasm Tier-1 is on for WebShumway. A global property rather than a
# default in the project: the web build reaches Shumway.Libraries through its
# own reference and through the stdlib bakers, and both must bake the same
# flavour (one property set per project, or two builds race on one obj).
# Read when the build starts from this directory; -p:ShumwayWasmTier=false on
# the command line wins and leaves the tier out.
-p:ShumwayWasmTier=true
